{"hero_usa_rifles(usa)" "A heavy rifle squad of 12 soldiers, composed of one bazooka, three rifle grenadiers, and two BAR teams. Having more rifle grenadiers, this squad is able to provide itself additional indirect firepower."}
; -- button hero, group h2561 --
; [new] card "hero_usa_m3_carbine(usa)" cost 2 lvl 1 | soldiers usa_nightfighter_leader x3, usa_nightfighter_carbine x6 | tags infantry all inf_only 39 40 41 42 43 44 45 | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:126
{"hero_usa_m3_carbine(usa)" "Two 3 man teams of elite marines with M2 Carbines equipped with M1 Sniper Scope night fighter attachment, dubbed under code word 'M2 with T3 Mounting'. This scope allows for high degree of accuracy but limited to only 60m range. The equipment is also rather heavy. Skill 6 except SL and SA at 7 skill"}
; -- button hero, group h1654 --
; [changed] card "hero1_usa" cost 2 lvl 1 | soldiers usa_82ndairborne_carbine x2 | vehicles airborne_spawner_m8_howitzer | tags all 42 43 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:128
{"hero1_usa" "The M8 Howitzer is a 75mm light howitzer that enables us to bolster the firepower of our airborne forces. This gun is best used behind cover, where it can take advantage of its arched trajectory. Although not the most accurate weapon, it is still capable of destroying light vehicles and field fortifications. Use it to your advantage and it will serve you well."}
; -- button hero, group h1222 --
; [new] card "hero_usa_m1_57mm_drop" cost 3 lvl 1 | soldiers usa_82ndairborne_carbine x2 | vehicles airborne_spawner_m1_57mm | tags all 42 43 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:131
{"hero_usa_m1_57mm_drop" "An air dropped M1_57mm AT gun with two veteran partroopers to arm it."}
; -- button hero, group h3 --
; [changed] card "hero4_usa" cost 4 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman x4, tankman2 | vehicles m4a3_zippo | tags all 44 45 hero flamethrower | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:133 | copy of m4a3_zippo (with crew)
{"hero4_usa" "The M4A3R2 Croc takes the regular chassis of our M4A3 Sherman, but replaces the coaxial machine gun with a devastating flamethrower. This enables the Croc to ferret out enemy troops and torch any cover that might potentially be use to conceal them. However, it lacks any improvements in armor, so care must be taken to ensure that it does not fall victim to the enemy. Make use of its speed to keep it out of enemy sights."}
; -- button hero, group h7 --
; [new] card "hero10_usa" cost 8 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x10 | vehicles 81mm_brandt_usa x2, m1_57mm x2, 30_browning_m1919a4 | tags all 42 43 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:135
{"hero10_usa" "The Support weapon platoon includes two M1 Mortars, one Browning 30.cal HMG and two M1 57mm Anti-tank guns."}
; -- button hero, group h5516 --
; [new] card "hero_usa_raiders" cost 7 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman x6, tankman2 x2, usa_raiderchad x2, usa_raider x6, usa_raidergren x2, usa_raiderbar x6, usa_raiderasst x6, usa_raiderdemo x2 | vehicles lvt4 x2 | tags all 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:137
{"hero_usa_raiders" "An elite mechanized detachment with two LVT4-A armed with 75mm howitzers and multiple machine guns each of these have a squad of elite marine raiders. Skill 5 except for the SL and SA at 6 skill"}
; -- button hero, group h8 --
; [changed] card "hero7_usa" cost 7 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman x20, tankman2 x5 | vehicles m4a3_75 x3, m4a3e8 x2 | tags all 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:139
{"hero7_usa" "The Mass Production of vehicles allows us to outnumber our enemies. While our tanks may not equal the armor and firepower of our enemies', we nevertheless make up for this technological gap by sheer power in number, which they can't hope to match. These two Sherman 76's will help you outmanoeuvre the enemy and allow you to deliver a crippling blow. Forward thrust -- let's drive them from the battlefield with our strength in numbers!"}
; -- button hero, group h88 --
; [new] card "fury_hero" cost 8 lvl 1 | soldiers elite_tankman x4, elite_tankman2 | vehicles m4a3e8_fury | tags all 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:140 | copy of m4a3e8_fury (with crew)
{"fury_hero" "The M4A3E8(76)W Fury is manned by an elite crew, giving it increased rate of fire, better overall mobility and carries a few special rounds of ammunition."}
; -- button hero, group h10 --
; [changed] card "hero8_usa" cost 10 lvl 1 | soldiers vet_tankman2, elite_101st_para3_asst, vet_tankman x4, vehicle_supporter x6 | vehicles m4a3e2_jumbo_76_vet, np_willys50 x2, np_willysat | tags all 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:141
{"hero8_usa" "The M4A3E2(76)W Jumbo is a field modification of the regular Jumbo variant. While retaining the superb armor of the Jumbo, the 75mm M3 gun has been upgraded to the 76mm high-velocity gun. This allows the Jumbo 76 to effectively engage and destroy even the heaviest of enemy armored vehicles, while being afforded a high level of protection by the Jumbo's thick armor. Some speed is sacrificed with this combination, but it can easily turn the tide of battle when used properly."}
; -- button hero, group h111 --
; [new] card "hero_usa_m36" cost 12 lvl 1 | soldiers vet_tankman x4, vet_tankman2 | vehicles m36_vet | tags all 44 45 hero | units/usa/vehicles_43-45.set:142 | copy of m36_vet (with crew)
{"hero_usa_m36" "A 90mm GMC M36 Slugger. Armed by a veteran crew, this vehicle can dispose of all but the heaviest of the enemy armour."}
